From 3b1aa8ae3cef3645889e4d9137b142cb4832313a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:25:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] One language's file copies resident: a language file slot
 written by LANGxx.BIN

The languages' copies of files (LANG_FILES: about 1,230 rows, 172 the most for one language) are no longer resident
rows of FILE_OFFSET_TABLE. The last LANG_SLOT_MAX rows of the table are the language file slot: each language build
holds its own copies there, langpatch writes the slot as one run of every LANGxx.BIN, and the disc writer gives its
rows their sectors in each LANGxx.BIN. modLangFile reads the copies' rows from LANG_SLOT.
---
 Makefile                 |  11 ++---
 include/dw/file_table.h  |   7 ++-
 src/main/file_table_us.c |  15 ++++--
 src/main/mod_options.c   |  13 ++---
 tools/gen_file_table.py  |  12 +++--
 tools/gen_lang_files.py  | 100 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++------------
 6 files changed, 109 insertions(+), 49 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
